  {
   "unit_type": "entry",
   "text": "Amazon's #1 Breast Pump — Upgraded | Now Smarter. Still #1. | Pump at Your Desk. No One Knows. | Pump Like Baby's Latch — No Pain | Control From Your Phone | Weighs only 232g — 2/3 the size of regular pumps. Fits inside any nursing bra. | The Momcozy M5 Smart Wearable Pump features seamless app control and historical tracking | Easily Adjust Modes, Suction Levels, And Settings Right from the Momcozy App | Momcozy M5 Smart: 3 modes, 9 levels, fits inside your bra. | M5 Smart's 105° flange + micro-vibration = painless pumping. 4 flange sizes.",
